 "description": "chainpeek: Compare USDC or USDT transfer fees on Base, Polygon, Ethereum, BNB, Arbitrum and Solana. For peg status use check_stablecoin_peg. Returns the fee of one USDC or USDT transfer on each chain, cheapest first; Solana adds lamport fees and new-token-account rent. Gas units are the standard 65,000, not measured. Cached 15 s. A chain that fails is listed last with an `error`; all failing is a 502 (not charged). Bad input is a 422 (not charged). Typically 1-5 s. Price: USD 0.002. Free: 10 chain reads per IP per UTC day. Docs: https://tanod.dev/learn/gas-price-api.html",
